WEBVTT

00:34:57.663 --> 00:35:04.230
or think through that R and D
and deployment plan

00:35:04.263 --> 00:35:05.863
that's necessary here.

00:35:05.863 --> 00:35:08.997
And so we have to make it an imperative

00:35:08.997 --> 00:35:13.130
that governments, hopefully of any party,

00:35:13.163 --> 00:35:14.597
join in to this.

00:35:14.630 --> 00:35:18.230
The pandemic, we did eventually
get global cooperation.

00:35:18.263 --> 00:35:21.230
The US didn't play its normal role there,

00:35:21.230 --> 00:35:25.797
but the private sector innovation
created the vaccine.

00:35:26.163 --> 00:35:27.863
Now, sadly, with climate,

00:35:27.863 --> 00:35:31.597
the pain it's causing
gets worse over time.